            <h2 class="rd-h2">What it is about</h2>
            <p>A coaching can have personal or professional occasions, and often the two interlock: professional concerns are frequently connected with your own dynamics and with the circumstances of the organization.</p>
            <p>Coaching suits people who want to develop personally and seek an exchange as equals. When an open question occupies you or you are pursuing a goal, growth emerges especially in conversation with others. We work on your concerns in a resource- and solution-oriented way: you expand your influence, develop additional skills and take responsibility for your own change processes. I accompany you in this; the decisions remain yours.</p><button class="rd-readmore" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="faq-toggle"></span><span class="rd-readmore-t">Read more</span></button>
